     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Bic ton,<div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><div>reference: help(plot, package=&quot;raster&quot;)</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7ItpsAWIpEI/WSmg0C9qvHI/AAAAAAAALlE/XaEhw_5KcdQJyVNBnOIrlI8H0lcWx5LIgCLcB/s1600/rasterPlotLegend.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7ItpsAWIpEI/WSmg0C9qvHI/AAAAAAAALlE/XaEhw_5KcdQJyVNBnOIrlI8H0lcWx5LIgCLcB/s1600/rasterPlotLegend.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237663762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ckEPEc4elfBDJPMnq8LJn\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7ItpsAWIpEI/WSmg0C9qvHI/AAAAAAAALlE/XaEhw_5KcdQJyVNBnOIrlI8H0lcWx5LIgCLcB/s400/rasterPlotLegend.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"373\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div><div># title: raster plot with customerized legend</div><div># date: 2017.5.27</div><div><br></div><div>library(raster)</div><div>r &lt;- raster(&quot;gmia_v5_aei_pct.asc&quot;)</div><div>legend.cols &lt;- c(&quot;yellow&quot;, &quot;orange&quot;, &quot;lightgreen&quot;, &quot;green&quot;, &quot;lightblue&quot;, &quot;deepskyblue&quot;, &quot;darkblue&quot;, &quot;hotpink&quot;, &quot;red&quot;)</div><div><a href=\"http://lengend.at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lengend.at&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237663762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UUF85RqupiEVOJbU2VeGV\">lengend.at</a> &lt;- c(0, 0.1, 1, 5, 10, 20, 35, 50, 75, 100)</div><div>legend.labels &lt;- c(&quot;0&quot;, levels(cut(c(0,100), <a href=\"http://lengend.at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lengend.at&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237663762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UUF85RqupiEVOJbU2VeGV\">lengend.at</a>)))</div><div>plot(r, </div><div>     breaks=<a href=\"http://lengend.at\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lengend.at&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237663762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UUF85RqupiEVOJbU2VeGV\">lengend.at</a>, </div><div>     col=legend.cols, </div><div>     lab.breaks=legend.labels, </div><div>     legend.shrink=0.9)</div><div># end</div></div></font></div></code></div><br>bic ton於 2017年5月23日星期二 UTC+8下午10時27分11秒寫道：<br></div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Dear all,</p>\r\n    <p>Is it possible to plot the attached map with such legend?</p>\r\n    <p>Thank you so much for your help.</p><p>library(raster)</p><p>ra=raster(gmia_v5_aei_pct.asc)</p><p>plot(ra)</p><p>Bic</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hc_DOK_ph7I/WSRGZ3UwUqI/AAAAAAAAAA8/iFlQPZGh7iYqRX-7lCwNump3nKRV9yWVgCLcB/s1600/legend.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hc_DOK_ph7I/WSRGZ3UwUqI/AAAAAAAAAA8/iFlQPZGh7iYqRX-7lCwNump3nKRV9yWVgCLcB/s1600/legend.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237663762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37clGCIVGiBamwnNB4IYAs\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-hc_DOK_ph7I/WSRGZ3UwUqI/AAAAAAAAAA8/iFlQPZGh7iYqRX-7lCwNump3nKRV9yWVgCLcB/s320/legend.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"186\"></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
